Either the pre-built kernels I made available (Test-pre34-11b) or any kernel
built from Alan's patches that include (most of) my patches, will not work
with MIT-SHM. I pulled out too many header file mods when porting older
patches to 2.0.34, most notably in shm.h, msg.h, and ipc.h.

Please, feel free to figure out what they are on your own (really very
easy), or wait a bit and I'll make a *full* Alpha version of 2.0.34
available (the "official" one from Alan may not be usable/buildable for
