> >Make your LD_LIBRARY_PATH pointing to the bin directory of lsl
> >distribution as first place to search for libs.
> 
> but when I do that , kdm complaints about wrong shared libraries, so I won't
> be able to use kdm anymore

put the LD_LIBRARY_PATH in a shell script... say for instance:

	MZHOME=/usr/local/netscape
	LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$MZHOME/bin:$MZHOME/lib:/lib:/usr/lib
	export LD_LIBRARY_PATH
	moz-static124 $*

this way it only affects the one executable.

mark


