definition is

#define __FDMASK(d)     ((__fd_mask) 1 << ((d) % __NFDBITS))

which is correct but indeed requires updates to glibc-devel before
recompilation.  Another critical macro defintions, corrected in
updates of glibc-devel, are in <selectbits.h>

> to 
