  things, but you could actually get into it and load a few pages.
- got egcs 1.0.2
- tried to compile qt libraries, and some modules wouldn't compile unless I
  turned off optimization.
- compiled qtscape, and when you attempted to run it, it crashed IMMEDIATELY
  with a memory error.
- compiled linux kernel, booted, and X wouldn't start
- got rid of egcs and recompiled everything with gcc.
- got egcs 1.0.3a
- compiled qt libraries successfully, example programs ran.
