I think I have to agree with Richard there; as with any large program
EGCS has a few bugs; but in general EGCS seems to have less bugs than
GCC 2,7,x.  This is especially true if you happen to have a RH 5.0/Alpha
system or if your doing big hairy C++ code on any platform.

