"initrd" is supported by Alpha kernels, IIRC.

However, MILO filesystem support, along with a number of other similar
things, is pretty much a roll-your-own set based (very) loosely on kernel
sources.  Many things, such as MD and RAMdisk, are not supported by MILO, at
least for the moment.

Best bet would be to keep root a simple device/filesystem; sorry...

