experience with *several* and it is really frustrating.

I wouldn't mind becoming a Canadian distributor myself because I know how
to return phone calls and e-mails.  The corporate customer doesn't mind
paying the little bit extra but they generally don't like to get fscked
around.

Get your act together, guys!

