On Sat, 13 Jun 1998, Kirk Vogelsang wrote:
> Anyone have any luck with the B&W quickcam?

I have a b/w qcam working with qcam-0.91
I had a little trouble at first with the wrong address for the port
and then bad values for the height and width were causing a scrambled
image.  Sometimes after a power outage the camera sends an extreemely dark
image for a few minutes and then it clears up..  

Here is my qcam.conf file:

port    0x3BC
width   320
height  240
top 1
left 14
transfer 1
bpp     6       # 64 shades of gray
mode 1
brightness 160 
contrast 124 
whitebal 240


Hope that helps!


