That's what I did, thanks.  Just wanted to make sure I was going about
things alright.  For anyone interested, all I did was

*) Edit arch/alpha/kernel/lca.c
*) Search for lca_machine_check
*) Recognize (blah)ECC_C in the switch
*) Add "if( blah.code != (blah)ECC_C )" ahead of the next loop/if/switch.

This looks like a good place to put in a bit-filter.  =)

