On Thu, 18 Jun 1998, Paul Tomblin wrote:

> Quoting Robert M. Toups, Jr. (dcwbmstr@linkmag.com):
> > Looking in my catalogs, I found a Matrox Mystique 220 w/ 4MB for $99.95. Is
> > this a good price and do I need to get an 8meg card to get the 1024 by 768
> > at 16 million colors or is 4 megs just dandy?
