I've been doing C++ full time for the last 4 years (until I switched to Java a
few months ago).  I happened to like the language, as long as you were
selective about which parts of the language you used.  Same with Java - it's a
very nice language, but feature creep is getting to it and allowing people to
do some *very* horrible stuff (like over using anonymous inner classes and the
